            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Project app icons

- Projects can now carry an app icon—shown in the sidebar, Dashboard cards, and project header across Mac, iPhone, iPad, and Android, and synced automatically through your vault.
- Choose or remove a project's icon from Project Card, or set it from the command line (`thimble projects icon`).
]]></description>
